#: ../../language/error_codes/E4134.md:1
msgid "E4134"
msgstr ""

#: ../../language/error_codes/E4134.md:3
msgid "Compiler diagnostic name: `invalid_foreach_pattern`."
msgstr "编译器诊断名称：`invalid_foreach_pattern`。"

#: ../../language/error_codes/E4134.md:5
msgid ""
"A pattern in a `for .. in` binding is not exhaustive for the value being "
"iterated over."
msgstr "`for .. in` 绑定中的模式对于正在迭代的值并不穷尽。"

#: ../../language/error_codes/E4134.md:8
msgid ""
"The loop body runs once for every item, so its binding pattern must match "
"every possible item. For example, `Some(value)` cannot bind an `Option[T]`, "
"because an item may be `None`."
msgstr ""
"循环体会对每个元素执行一次，因此绑定模式必须匹配所有可能的元素。例如，"
"`Some(value)` 不能绑定 `Option[T]`，因为元素可能是 `None`。"

#: ../../language/error_codes/E4134.md:12
msgid "Erroneous example"
msgstr "错误示例"

#: ../../language/error_codes/E4134.md:14
msgid ""
"///|\n"
"pub fn print_values(values : Array[Option[Int]]) -> Unit {\n"
"  for Some(value) in values {\n"
"    println(value)\n"
"  }\n"
"}\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../language/error_codes/E4134.md:18
msgid "Suggestion"
msgstr "建议"

#: ../../language/error_codes/E4134.md:20
msgid ""
"Bind the whole item and handle alternatives inside the loop, or use an "
"exhaustive destructuring pattern such as a tuple or record pattern."
msgstr ""
"请绑定整个元素并在循环体内处理不同分支，或使用元组模式、记录模式等穷尽的解构"
"模式。"

#: ../../language/error_codes/E4134.md:23
msgid ""
"///|\n"
"pub fn print_values(values : Array[Option[Int]]) -> Unit {\n"
"  for value in values {\n"
"    match value {\n"
"      Some(value) => println(value)\n"
"      None => ()\n"
"    }\n"
"  }\n"
"}\n"
msgstr ""
